<title>FRANCE: Alcatel discusses Thomson bid with Aerospatiale,Dassault.</title>
<headline>Alcatel discusses Thomson bid with Aerospatiale,Dassault.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcatel Alsthom on Monday said it was in talks with state-owned Aerospatiale and Dassault Aviation about a possible joint offer for the state's majority stake in Thomson-CSF.</p>
<p>&quot;There are discussions with the companies mentioned in the press,&quot; a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>Earlier on Monday, Prime Minister Alain Juppe said a decision about the sale of Thomson-CSF would be made before the end of February.</p>
</text>
